### Triage service — manual examples (IntelliJ HTTP Client)
# Run the service (docker compose up -d postgres kafka redis, then the app) and execute the requests in order:
# the registration stores the new patient id in {{patientId}} for the following requests.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### RF-01 — Register example E1 (expected: 201, nivel CRITICO, slaMinutos 5)
POST {{baseUrl}}/triage/pacientes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombreCompleto": "Ana Pérez",
  "edad": 45,
  "frecuenciaCardiaca": 130,
  "presionSistolica": 180,
  "presionDiastolica": 110,
  "spo2": 97,
  "temperatura": 36.8,
  "dolor": 8,
  "gcs": 15,
  "quejaPrincipal": "Dolor torácico"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("patientId", response.body.id);
%}

### RF-02 — Get the patient (expected: 200, estado REGISTRADO, tiempoEnEstadoActual like PT1M5S)
GET {{baseUrl}}/triage/pacientes/{{patientId}}

### RF-02 — Start the consultation (expected: 200, estado EN_CONSULTA)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/triage/pacientes/{{patientId}}/estado
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "estado": "EN_CONSULTA"
}

### RF-02 — Same status again (expected: 409, "No se puede pasar de EN_CONSULTA a EN_CONSULTA: ...")
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/triage/pacientes/{{patientId}}/estado
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "estado": "EN_CONSULTA"
}

### RF-02 — Discharge (expected: 200, estado ALTA)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/triage/pacientes/{{patientId}}/estado
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "estado": "ALTA"
}

### RF-02 — Invalid transition (expected: 409, "No se puede pasar de ALTA a EN_CONSULTA.")
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/triage/pacientes/{{patientId}}/estado
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "estado": "EN_CONSULTA"
}

### RF-02 — Unknown status value (expected: 400, errors[0].campo = estado)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/triage/pacientes/{{patientId}}/estado
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "estado": "CERRADO"
}

### RF-02 — Id that is not a UUID (expected: 400, errors[0].campo = id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/triage/pacientes/abc

### RF-02 — Unknown patient (expected: 404, "Paciente no encontrado")
GET {{baseUrl}}/triage/pacientes/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
